# Secrets
.env

# Runtime state: caches, usage ledger, calibrated thresholds, feedback
.runtime/

# The ~350 MB database bundle IS committed, via Git LFS (see .gitattributes), so the repo is
# runnable straight after a clone. Note the cost: GitHub's free LFS allowance is 1 GB of
# storage and 1 GB of bandwidth per month, and a full clone pulls ~350 MB of that — roughly
# three clones a month. If that becomes a problem, drop these files from LFS and publish the
# bundle as a GitHub Release asset (no bandwidth quota) or a Hugging Face dataset instead;
# scripts/fetch_data.py already knows how to pull it back down.
#
# Transient LanceDB bookkeeping — no value in version control.
data/legal_db/**/_transactions/
data/legal_db/**/_deletions/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Crawl4AI's own cache
.crawl4ai/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
